{'query': 'average cost of daily meals per person in India 2024', 'results': [{'title': 'Cost of Living Index by Country 2026 Mid-Year', 'url': 'https://www.numbeo.com/cost-of-living/rankings_by_country.jsp', 'snippet': 'By Country : Cost of Living Index, Rent Index, Restaurant Prices Index, Transportation Price Index, Grocery Price Index, Local Purchasing Power IndexNet-To-Gross Salary Converter. Per Diem Allowance Calculator.'}, {'title': 'World Cost of Living Calculator: 9294 cities, 197 countries', 'url': 'https://livingcost.org/cost', 'snippet': 'This international cost of living calculator allows by city and by country comparison worldwide: 9294 cities and 197 countries around the globe. The cost of living is calculated based on prices for rent, food, transport, and other living expenses for each city.'}, {'title': 'India Population (2026) - Worldometer', 'url': 'https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/india-population/', 'snippet': 'India 2026 population is estimated at 1,476,625,576 people at mid-year. India population is equivalent to 17.8% of the total world population. India ranks number 1 in the list of countries (and dependencies) by population.'}, {'title': 'India Population 2026', 'url': 'https://worldpopulationreview.com/countries/india', 'snippet': 'As of 2026, India has a total population of 1,476,625,576, ranking as the 1st most populous nation in the world. India has a net population change of approximately 34,660 people per day, driven by 62,939 births, 27,073 deaths, and net emigration of 1,206 people.'}, {'title': 'India population (2026) live — Countrymeters', 'url': 'https://countrymeters.info/en/India', 'snippet': 'The current population of India is 1,493,883,679 as of Thursday, September 24, 2026. Population clock live, current, historical and projected population. Births, deaths and migration of population.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.8785084999981336}
{'query': 'cheap vegetarian dinner recipes with ingredient costs', 'results': [{'title': '11 Cheap Vegetarian Meals (less than £1 / $1 per serving!) - Easy Cheesy Vegetarian', 'url': 'https://www.easycheesyvegetarian.com/cheap-vegetarian-meals/', 'snippet': 'June 24, 2026 - Made with budget-friendly ingredients like lentils and potatoes, moussaka is a hearty dinner recipe that will leave you feeling totally satisfied. This vegetarian moussaka is a classic Greek dish made with aubergine and lentils in a rich tomatoey sauce. The perfect healthy vegetarian comfort food! ... Get the recipe here! 💵 Approximate cost: £0.70 ($0.82) per serving (4 fritters per serving)'}, {'title': 'Budget Friendly Vegetarian Recipes - Happy Veggie Kitchen', 'url': 'https://www.happyveggiekitchen.com/recipes/budget-friendly/', 'snippet': 'These vegetarian recipes can be made on a budget! The decision over what recipes to include here was subjective, but generally I consider recipes budget friendly if any or a few of the following criteria apply: They use naturally low cost and easy to source ingredients.* They have some more ...'}, {'title': '41 Budget Vegetarian Recipes | olivemagazine', 'url': 'https://www.olivemagazine.com/recipes/vegetarian/vegetarian-budget-recipes/', 'snippet': 'September 5, 2025 - You can leave out the avocado to keep costs down. If you already have cumin, ground coriander and turmeric in your cupboard, this vibrant vegan curry becomes a brilliant budget dish. This vegan curry cuts corners using shop-bought vegan curry paste mixed with ginger, mangetout, red pepper and vegan Quorn. Make the most of the cheap ingredients lurking in your cupboard. Potatoes, chickpeas and chopped tomatoes are the stars of this lightly spiced vegan curry. This speedy vegan dinner features cheap everyday ingredients, including ginger, garlic, chilli and soy sauce, while frozen stir-fry veggies keep prep to a minimum.'}, {'title': '400+ Budget-Friendly Vegetarian Recipes - Budget Bytes', 'url': 'https://www.budgetbytes.com/category/recipes/vegetarian/', 'snippet': 'This easy Butternut Squash Lasagna is a cozy vegetarian dinner with roasted squash, mushrooms, kale, cheese, and creamy sage brown butter béchamel. ... These easy Roasted Sweet Potatoes turn tender, naturally sweet, and deliciously caramelized ...'}, {'title': 'Budget Vegetarian Recipes | Good Food', 'url': 'https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/budget-vegetarian-recipes', 'snippet': 'January 28, 2026 - Make a budget vegetarian supper with simple, storecupboard ingredients. Try a nourishing soup, a hearty pie or a curry to feed a crowd. Try these meat-free budget meal ideas, then check out our budget vegan recipes and main collection of budget recipes.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.05712750001112}
{'query': 'cheap non-vegetarian dinner recipes with ingredient costs', 'results': [{'title': 'allrecipes.com/recipes/17562/dinner', 'url': 'https://www.allrecipes.com/recipes/17562/dinner/', 'snippet': 'Dinner plate with pasta, green beans, and garlic bread Dinner Recipes.'}, {'title': '370 Non-Vegitarian Dinner Ideas in 2026 | recipes, dinner, cooking...', 'url': 'https://www.pinterest.com/siguy465/non-vegitarian-dinner-ideas/', 'snippet': 'See more ideas about recipes, dinner, cooking recipes.Discover delicious Healthy Protein Bowls Lunch ideas that will keep you energized all day. These simple power bowls combine nutrient-dense ingredients with Power Bowl Recipe Clean Eating principles for maximum satisfaction.'}, {'title': '5-ingredient summer dinner recipes that take 30 minutes or less', 'url': 'https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/howto/5-ingredient-summer-dinner-recipes-that-take-30-minutes-or-less', 'snippet': 'Discover delicious five-ingredient dinners you can whip up in under 30 minutes. Enjoy fuss-free, flavourful meals with minimal shopping and effort.'}, {'title': "37 Easy Dinner Ideas When You're Not Sure What To Make", 'url': 'https://tasty.co/article/melissaharrison/easy-dinner-recipes', 'snippet': 'This recipe is such a seamless, brilliant way to cook an entire pasta meal in 30 minutes. Try swapping out the sauce ingredients with different herbs, seasonings, and sauces for a new twist every time you make it. Dinner winner, for sure! Recipe: One-Pot Garlic-Parmesan Chicken Pasta.'}, {'title': '5 One-pan Dinner Ideas | Simple Home Edit', 'url': 'https://simplehomeedit.com/recipe/5-one-pan-dinner-ideas/', 'snippet': 'Here you’ll find easy, delicious, low-cost family dinner ideas that you can make with simple ingredients, without having to spend hours in the kitchen!'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 3.5351771999849007}
{'query': 'budget-friendly breakfast and lunch recipes with ingredient costs', 'results': [{'title': 'Easy & Budget-Friendly Recipes - Budget Bytes', 'url': 'https://www.budgetbytes.com/category/recipes/', 'snippet': 'Over 1000 easy and delicious budget-friendly recipes to keep you full and happy! Best dinner, lunch, chicken, beef, and vegetarian recipes, plus cooking tips and more.'}, {'title': '27 Cheap Breakfast Ideas: Recipes for Easy, Budget-Friendly Meals', 'url': 'https://www.tasteofhome.com/collection/cheap-breakfast-ideas/', 'snippet': 'May 19, 2025 · Inexpensive breakfast recipes make the most of these basic ingredients, delivering variety without compromising on flavor. This collection of low-cost breakfast options includes practical choices for busy weekday mornings and robust weekend brunch options for feeding a sleepy crew.'}, {'title': '120+ Easy Breakfast Recipe Ideas Budget Bytes', 'url': 'https://www.budgetbytes.com/category/recipes/breakfast/', 'snippet': 'Over 120 budget-friendly breakfast recipes to start your day off right! From easy weekday breakfast ideas to fancy weekend brunch recipes, we’ve got it. Pick from the menu below to find sweet or savory breakfast recipes, baked goods, cold or hot recipes, and breakfast meal prep ideas.'}, {'title': '34 Cheap Lunch Ideas for Easy, Budget-Friendly Meals', 'url': 'https://www.tasteofhome.com/collection/cheap-lunch-ideas/', 'snippet': 'Jun 25, 2025 · These cheap lunch ideas, from hearty soups to easy wraps, are simple, filling and satisfying recipes to power you through busy days.'}, {'title': 'Budget Recipes - 60+ Ideas For Cheap, Easy & Healthy Meals', 'url': 'https://yummyinspirations.net/budget-recipes/', 'snippet': 'Budget Recipes – 60+ Ideas for cheap meals including easy healthy breakfast, lunch, dinner, snacks and desserts with low budget, super frugal ingredients. These budget recipes have all been tried, tested and enjoyed through my 11+ years of food blogging.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.413106499996502}
